<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans fell - April 9 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans fell - April 9 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED APRIL 2 (Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............800,400 down...6,100</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......712,700 up.....1,600</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......547,800 up.....5,500</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED APRIL 9</p>
<p>U.S. commercial paper.....840,554 up ....2,125</p>
<p>Financial companies.......652,741 up.....1,222</p>
<p>New York business loans....45,344 down.....777</p>
<p>Excluding acceptances......45,079 down.....768</p>
</text>
